          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba bakateeka ba Bafilisiti balongene mukutuula ilambo ilikankala ku mulungu wabo Dagoni elyo nokuti basangalale, pantu balandile ukuti, “Umulungu wesu nautupeela Samsoni, umulwani wesu, mu maboko yesu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba ilyo abantu bamwene Samsoni, batendeke ukutasha umulungu wabo no kutila, “Umulungu wesu nautupeela umulwani wesu mu maboko yesu, umuntu umo uwaonaula icalo cesu no kufusha imfwa mu kwipaulula kwa bantu besu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo imitima yabo ninshi icili ne nsansa ishingi nganshi, batampile ukupunda abati, “Kaleteni Samsoni ese atusansamusheko.” Awe nabo baitile Samsoni ukufuma mu cifungo no kwisa mukwangala ku ntanshi yabo. Kabili bamwiminike pakati ka nceshi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Samsoni aebele umubomfi uwamwikete pa kuboko kwakwe ati, “Ntwala pa ncende apabela inceshi ishaikasha itempele, pakuti eko nshintilile.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba mwitempele mwali cinkupiti wa bantu, abaume na banakashi. Bakateeka bonse ba Bafilisiti nabo emo bali, elyo pa mutenge we tempele pali abantu ukulingana amakana yatatu (3,000), abaume na banakashi abaletamba kufyo Samsoni aleyangala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Samsoni apepele kuli Yawe no kutila, “Mwe Mfumu Yawe, njibukisheniko. Mwe Lesa napapata nkoseleshenikofye uno wine muku. Kabili nengeni ukuti nandule ku Bafilisiti pa menso yandi yabili aya bantonkola.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Samsoni apalamine ku nceshi shibili isha pakati ishaikeshe ili tempele. Aikete ukuboko kwa kulyo kuli lumo elyo no kuboko kwa kuso kuli lumbi kabili ashintililako na maka ayakalamba nganshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atile, “Lekeni nomba mfwile pamo na Bafilisiti!” Elyo asunkile na maka nganshi, ne tempele lyabongolokele pali bakateeka na bantu bonse abali mukati. Eico abafwilile pamo nankwe balifulishe ukucila abo aipeye ilyo ali umumi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
